# Two kinds of file are not documents and are skipped whole.
#
# 1. Vendored from mattpocock/skills. The instruction bodies are byte-identical
#    to upstream by design, as documented in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, and
#    upstream leaves some of its own fences unlabelled and its own lines long.
#    To update: re-fetch the upstream file, re-apply only the frontmatter
#    additions, then re-run the diff against upstream. Never edit in place.
skills/grill-me/SKILL.md
skills/grilling/SKILL.md

# 2. Agent prompt wrappers. Their first line is the instruction sent to the
#    agent, not a heading, and they carry no prose structure to check.
command/*.md
